msgid "``[None, 1, 2, None, 3]``"
msgstr "``[None, 1, 2, None, 3]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:206
msgid ""
"Passing ``None`` as the function makes ``filter`` keep only truthy items, "
"dropping the two ``0`` values."
msgstr ""
"Pasar ``None`` como función hace que ``filter`` conserve solo los elementos "
"con valor de verdad verdadero, descartando los dos valores ``0``."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:223
msgid "``['10', '2', '9']``"
msgstr "``['10', '2', '9']``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:224
msgid "``['2', '9', '10']``"
msgstr "``['2', '9', '10']``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:225
msgid "``['2', '10', '9']``"
msgstr "``['2', '10', '9']``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:226
msgid "``['9', '2', '10']``"
msgstr "``['9', '2', '10']``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:231
msgid ""
"These are *strings*, so they sort character by character: ``'1' < '2' < "
"'9'``. ``\"10\"`` comes first because its first character ``'1'`` is "
"smallest."
msgstr ""
"Estas son *cadenas*, así que se ordenan carácter por carácter: ``'1' < '2' <"
" '9'``. ``\"10\"`` va primero porque su primer carácter ``'1'`` es el menor."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:256
msgid ""
"``bool`` is a subclass of ``int``: ``True == 1`` and ``False == 0``, so the "
"sum is ``2``."
msgstr ""
"``bool`` es una subclase de ``int``: ``True == 1`` y ``False == 0``, así que"
" la suma es ``2``."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:274
msgid "``4``"
msgstr "``4``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:275
msgid "``3.99``"
msgstr "``3.99``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:276
msgid "``3.0``"
msgstr "``3.0``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:281
msgid ""
"``int`` on a float truncates toward zero (it does not round), so ``3.99`` "
"becomes ``3``."
msgstr ""
"``int`` sobre un flotante trunca hacia cero (no redondea), así que ``3.99`` "
"se convierte en ``3``."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:298
msgid "``[10, 8, 6, 4, 2, 0]``"
msgstr "``[10, 8, 6, 4, 2, 0]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:299
msgid "``[8, 6, 4, 2, 0]``"
msgstr "``[8, 6, 4, 2, 0]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:300
