msgstr "``[10, 8, 6, 4, 2, 1]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:301
msgid "``[10, 8, 6, 4, 2]``"
msgstr "``[10, 8, 6, 4, 2]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:306
msgid ""
"``range`` counts down by 2 from ``10`` and stops *before* the stop value "
"``0``, so ``0`` is not included."
msgstr ""
"``range`` cuenta hacia atrás de 2 en 2 desde ``10`` y se detiene *antes* del"
" valor de parada ``0``, así que ``0`` no se incluye."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:324
