msgstr "``99``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:325
msgid "``None``"
msgstr "``None``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:326
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:331
msgid ""
"``min`` of an empty iterable normally raises ``ValueError``, but the "
"``default`` keyword supplies a fallback instead."
msgstr ""
"``min`` de un iterable vacío normalmente lanza ``ValueError``, pero el "
"argumento ``default`` proporciona un valor de reserva en su lugar."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:349
msgid "``'123'``"
msgstr "``'123'``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:350
msgid "``['1', '2', '3']``"
msgstr "``['1', '2', '3']``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:351
msgid "``[str, str, str]``"
msgstr "``[str, str, str]``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:356
msgid ""
"``map`` applies ``str`` to each item, converting every number to its string "
"form."
msgstr ""
"``map`` aplica ``str`` a cada elemento, convirtiendo cada número a su forma "
"de cadena."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:373
msgid "``[(0, 'a'), (1, 'b')]``"
