#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:406
msgid ""
"``sorted(\"banana\")`` orders the characters into ``['a', 'a', 'a', 'b', "
"'n', 'n']``, which ``\"\".join`` glues back into a string."
msgstr ""
"``sorted(\"banana\")`` ordena los caracteres en ``['a', 'a', 'a', 'b', 'n', "
"'n']``, que ``\"\".join`` vuelve a unir en una cadena."

