msgstr "``c``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:432
msgid ""
"``ord('a')`` is ``97``; adding ``1`` gives ``98``; ``chr(98)`` is ``'b'``."
msgstr ""
"``ord('a')`` es ``97``; sumar ``1`` da ``98``; ``chr(98)`` es ``'b'``."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:450
msgid "``' '``"
msgstr "``' '``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:451 ../../../builtins-medium.rst:498
msgid "``1``"
msgstr "``1``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:456
msgid ""
"A string containing a single space is *not empty*, so it is truthy — "
"whitespace still counts as content."
msgstr ""
"Una cadena que contiene un único espacio *no está vacía*, así que tiene "
"valor de verdad verdadero — los espacios en blanco también cuentan como "
"contenido."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:473
msgid "``(-3, -1)``"
msgstr "``(-3, -1)``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:474
msgid "``(-3, 1)``"
msgstr "``(-3, 1)``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:475
msgid "``(-4, 1)``"
msgstr "``(-4, 1)``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:476
msgid "``(-4, -1)``"
msgstr "``(-4, -1)``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:481
msgid ""
"Floor division rounds toward negative infinity: ``-7 // 2 == -4`` and ``-7 %"
" 2 == 1`` (the remainder takes the sign of the divisor)."
msgstr ""
"La división entera redondea hacia menos infinito: ``-7 // 2 == -4`` y ``-7 %"
" 2 == 1`` (el resto toma el signo del divisor)."

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:500
msgid "``-1``"
msgstr "``-1``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:501
msgid "``-3``"
msgstr "``-3``"

#: ../../../builtins-medium.rst:506
msgid ""
"The ``key`` negates each value, so the item with the largest key (``-1`` "
"from ``1``) wins. ``max`` returns the original item ``1``, not the key."
msgstr ""
"La ``key`` niega cada valor, así que gana el elemento con la clave mayor "
"(``-1`` a partir de ``1``). ``max`` devuelve el elemento original ``1``, no "
"la clave."
